## Third-party components

This application bundles or links the following third-party software, each
under its own license:

- Sparkle (MIT) — https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle
- GRDB.swift (MIT) — https://github.com/groue/GRDB.swift
- Chromaprint `fpcalc` (LGPL-2.1) — https://acoustid.org/chromaprint
  Redistributed as a standalone executable in `Resources/bin/fpcalc`.
  Source is available from the Chromaprint project above.

Track metadata and artwork are retrieved at runtime from MusicBrainz,
the iTunes Search API, AcoustID, Cover Art Archive, and Deezer, each subject
to their respective terms of use.
